{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-2221","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2602","text":"The [&] Umbrella — one stack: declare → … → observe"}]},{"id":"blk-2222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2603","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-2604","text":" living map · "},{"id":"spn-2605","marks":["bold"],"text":"Audience:"},{"id":"spn-2606","text":" anyone trying to see how "},{"id":"spn-2607","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-2608","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2609","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2610","text":", CC1, and CC2 fit into a single system rather than separate folders."}]},{"id":"blk-2223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2611","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-2612","text":" (AmpersandBoxDesign) is the umbrella. "},{"id":"spn-2613","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2614","text":" is the governance "},{"id":"spn-2615","marks":["bold"],"text":"engine"},{"id":"spn-2616","text":" that lives inside it ("},{"id":"spn-2617","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/"},{"id":"spn-2618","text":"). They are not competing protocols and they are not redundant — they are different layers of one pipeline. This document is the single place that draws that pipeline and marks what exists vs. what is still spec-only."}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2225","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2619","text":"One-line mental model: "},{"id":"spn-2620","marks":["bold"],"text":"`[&]` declares and composes capabilities; `box-and-box` decides whether a composed action is `feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best`; MCP/A2A wire the result to the world."}]}],"id":"blk-2224","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-2226","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2621","text":"1. The pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-2227","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2622","text":"A capability set flows through seven stages:"}]},{"id":"blk-2228","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"declare → validate → compose → govern → wire → run → observe"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-2230","spans":[{"id":"spn-2623","text":"Stage"}]},{"id":"blk-2231","spans":[{"id":"spn-2624","text":"Question it answers"}]},{"id":"blk-2232","spans":[{"id":"spn-2625","text":"Owned by"}]},{"id":"blk-2233","spans":[{"id":"spn-2626","text":"Status"}]}],"id":"blk-2229","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-2234","spans":[{"id":"spn-2627","marks":["bold"],"text":"declare"}]},{"id":"blk-2235","spans":[{"id":"spn-2628","text":"what capabilities, held by whom, piped how?"}]},{"id":"blk-2236","spans":[{"id":"spn-2629","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-2630","text":" schema ("},{"id":"spn-2631","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-2632","text":"); CC2 coalition object"}]},{"id":"blk-2237","spans":[{"id":"spn-2633","text":"CC1 ✅ shipped · CC2 "},{"id":"spn-2634","marks":["code"],"text":"coalition.schema.json"},{"id":"spn-2635","text":" ✅ shipped (no runtime yet)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2238","spans":[{"id":"spn-2636","marks":["bold"],"text":"validate"}]},{"id":"blk-2239","spans":[{"id":"spn-2637","text":"does the declaration conform?"}]},{"id":"blk-2240","spans":[{"id":"spn-2638","marks":["code"],"text":"@ampersand-protocol/validate"},{"id":"spn-2639","text":" (npm), Python SDK, Elixir "},{"id":"spn-2640","marks":["code"],"text":"schema.ex"}]},{"id":"blk-2241","spans":[{"id":"spn-2641","text":"✅ — "},{"id":"spn-2642","marks":["bold"],"text":"CC1 only"},{"id":"spn-2643","text":" (CC2 validates via the schema directly, ajv)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2242","spans":[{"id":"spn-2644","marks":["bold"],"text":"compose"}]},{"id":"blk-2243","spans":[{"id":"spn-2645","text":"do the "},{"id":"spn-2646","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2647","text":" / `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-2244","spans":[{"id":"spn-2648","text":">` combinations hold?"}]},{"id":"blk-2245","spans":[{"id":"spn-2649","text":"Elixir "},{"id":"spn-2650","marks":["code"],"text":"compose.ex"},{"id":"spn-2651","text":"; CC2 lifts `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-2246","spans":[{"id":"spn-2652","text":">` to a governed pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-2247","spans":[{"id":"spn-2653","text":"CC1 "},{"id":"spn-2654","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2655","text":" ✅ · `\\"}]},{"id":"blk-2248","spans":[{"id":"spn-2656","text":">"},{"id":"spn-2657","marks":["code"],"text":" still lawless · CC1→singleton-coalition lift ✅ ("},{"id":"spn-2658","text":"box-and-box lift`) · cross-agent coalition compose ❌"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2249","spans":[{"id":"spn-2659","marks":["bold"],"text":"govern"}]},{"id":"blk-2250","spans":[{"id":"spn-2660","text":"is this action "},{"id":"spn-2661","marks":["code"],"text":"feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best"},{"id":"spn-2662","text":"?"}]},{"id":"blk-2251","spans":[{"id":"spn-2663","marks":["bold"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2664","text":" (8 rungs, 103 laws)"}]},{"id":"blk-2252","spans":[{"id":"spn-2665","text":"engine ✅ · CC1 governance bridge ✅ ("},{"id":"spn-2666","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box compile"},{"id":"spn-2667","text":") · coalition wiring ❌"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2253","spans":[{"id":"spn-2668","marks":["bold"],"text":"wire"}]},{"id":"blk-2254","spans":[{"id":"spn-2669","text":"emit MCP + A2A configs"}]},{"id":"blk-2255","spans":[{"id":"spn-2670","text":"Elixir "},{"id":"spn-2671","marks":["code"],"text":"mcp.ex"},{"id":"spn-2672","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-2673","marks":["code"],"text":"a2a.ex"}]},{"id":"blk-2256","spans":[{"id":"spn-2674","text":"✅ — CC1 only"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2257","spans":[{"id":"spn-2675","marks":["bold"],"text":"run"}]},{"id":"blk-2258","spans":[{"id":"spn-2676","text":"gate every effect "},{"id":"spn-2677","marks":["italic"],"text":"before"},{"id":"spn-2678","text":" it fires (interpositional host)"}]},{"id":"blk-2259","spans":[{"id":"spn-2679","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/aios/"},{"id":"spn-2680","text":" reference host"}]},{"id":"blk-2260","spans":[{"id":"spn-2681","text":"illustrative only ❌ no real runtime"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2261","spans":[{"id":"spn-2682","marks":["bold"],"text":"observe"}]},{"id":"blk-2262","spans":[{"id":"spn-2683","text":"emit an auditable decision certificate + evolve the policy on a provenance chain"}]},{"id":"blk-2263","spans":[{"id":"spn-2684","text":"box-and-box certs + "},{"id":"spn-2685","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2686","text":" hash-chain + PULSE cross-loop bus"}]},{"id":"blk-2264","spans":[{"id":"spn-2687","text":"certs ✅ · provenance chain + measured/priced/certified "},{"id":"spn-2688","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve()"},{"id":"spn-2689","text":" ✅ (EV1–EV6) · CloudEvents emission (CC2 §7) ❌"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-2265","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2690","text":"Two supporting artifacts sit alongside: the "},{"id":"spn-2691","marks":["bold"],"text":"registry"},{"id":"spn-2692","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2693","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol/registry/v0.1.0/"},{"id":"spn-2694","text":", ✅) and the "},{"id":"spn-2695","marks":["bold"],"text":"conformance suite"},{"id":"spn-2696","text":" (103 laws — ✅ in JS, no second-host cross-language harness yet ❌)."}]},{"id":"blk-2266","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2697","text":"2. The govern stage is split in two (the keystone gap)"}]},{"id":"blk-2267","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2698","text":"Today there are "},{"id":"spn-2699","marks":["bold"],"text":"two governance implementations that do not talk to each other"},{"id":"spn-2700","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-2268","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2270","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2701","marks":["code"],"text":"reference/elixir/ampersand_core/governance.ex"},{"id":"spn-2702","text":" — the CC1 governance block evaluator. Parses flat compact conditions ("},{"id":"spn-2703","marks":["code"],"text":"confidence_below:0.75"},{"id":"spn-2704","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2705","marks":["code"],"text":"cost_exceeds_usd:1000"},{"id":"spn-2706","text":") into "},{"id":"spn-2707","marks":["code"],"text":"pass"},{"id":"spn-2708","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2709","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-2710","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2711","marks":["code"],"text":"block"},{"id":"spn-2712","text":". Ad-hoc, no algebra. This is the \"flat governance block\" CC2 §0 explicitly sets out to replace."}]}],"id":"blk-2269","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2272","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2713","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/"},{"id":"spn-2714","text":" — the real 8-rung modal arithmetic with 103 property-tested laws. Takes its "},{"id":"spn-2715","marks":["bold"],"text":"own"},{"id":"spn-2716","text":" decision-spec JSON ("},{"id":"spn-2717","marks":["code"],"text":"{req, norms, options}"},{"id":"spn-2718","text":"), not an "},{"id":"spn-2719","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-2720","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-2271","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-2273","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2721","text":"Nothing bridges them. Until a composed "},{"id":"spn-2722","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-2723","text":" capability set's "},{"id":"spn-2724","marks":["code"],"text":"governance"},{"id":"spn-2725","text":" block is evaluated "},{"id":"spn-2726","marks":["italic"],"text":"through"},{"id":"spn-2727","text":" the box-and-box rungs, the umbrella is two products in one repo. "},{"id":"spn-2728","marks":["bold"],"text":"Closing this is the single highest-leverage step"},{"id":"spn-2729","text":"; everything else (CC2 schema, coalition compose, interpositional host) builds on it."}]},{"id":"blk-2274","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2730","text":"The bridge is a deterministic translation (no LLM, no network) from the CC1 governance block to a box-and-box policy:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-2276","spans":[{"id":"spn-2731","marks":["code"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-2732","text":" governance (CC1)"}]},{"id":"blk-2277","spans":[{"id":"spn-2733","text":"box-and-box"}]},{"id":"blk-2278","spans":[{"id":"spn-2734","text":"Rung"}]}],"id":"blk-2275","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-2279","spans":[{"id":"spn-2735"